{
  "model": "hexgrad/Kokoro-82M-v1.1-zh",
  "voice": "zm_010",
  "clips": {
    "0735621579fab08e": {
      "text": "天黑请闭眼。请根据设备上的提示行动，保守自己的身份秘密。",
      "duration": 6.275,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/0735621579fab08e.mp3",
      "textHash": "0735621579fab08e5031dd418d5e479d82165d5d6a889835602fcff979b03ac0"
    },
    "c824a1274f3b4954": {
      "text": "天亮了，请睁眼。请查看设备上的昨夜结果。",
      "duration": 4.8,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/c824a1274f3b4954.mp3",
      "textHash": "c824a1274f3b495444a3a6051e66c49ef0d3000dc89fa5ca6cf51c7234bdd274"
    },
    "98f1fc9ab041461e": {
      "text": "现在开始白天讨论。请认真听取发言，等待房主开启投票。",
      "duration": 6.5,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/98f1fc9ab041461e.mp3",
      "textHash": "98f1fc9ab041461e5398e1cf5764b15bf5ec6f22271580358fcbdc6edbd7aba3"
    },
    "72510a6b6bdd50cd": {
      "text": "现在开始警长投票。请选择你希望当选警长的玩家，或选择弃票。",
      "duration": 6.775,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/72510a6b6bdd50cd.mp3",
      "textHash": "72510a6b6bdd50cd32c66506406c0233a33df83e17b9ca96edb24bd8e3b52638"
    },
    "0fd06459148508b0": {
      "text": "现在开始放逐投票。请选择你要放逐的玩家，或选择弃票，并在设备上提交。",
      "duration": 7.625,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/0fd06459148508b0.mp3",
      "textHash": "0fd06459148508b0409303ad37d64d32c4014467c045db48615f4861255d8142"
    },
    "bf86fd9382fd8e9d": {
      "text": "投票结束。请查看设备上的投票结果，并按提示发动技能。",
      "duration": 6.075,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/bf86fd9382fd8e9d.mp3",
      "textHash": "bf86fd9382fd8e9d071e3b6437f1e52601e6f129703cc6c8138329faccc2d6f4"
    },
    "f9e3742286493478": {
      "text": "游戏结束。现在可以公开身份。请一起查看结果，回顾这场对局。",
      "duration": 6.7,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/f9e3742286493478.mp3",
      "textHash": "f9e37422864934781c9b1e1b450f9509cd92fff2a18f25c857920aa036bb2375"
    },
    "1fb07ee62dd3d8c1": {
      "text": "游戏已暂停。请等待房主恢复房间。",
      "duration": 4.45,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/1fb07ee62dd3d8c1.mp3",
      "textHash": "1fb07ee62dd3d8c1d502b32b3f7fdff7ec0b0caecb5f11dd917d34bf744f9a43"
    },
    "9e0924dc38dbfd8d": {
      "text": "现在需要结算一项技能。相关玩家请根据设备上的私密提示行动，其他玩家请稍候。",
      "duration": 8.1,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/9e0924dc38dbfd8d.mp3",
      "textHash": "9e0924dc38dbfd8d005ecddcd0ac906f0dc88c452bbadd6bcfae507fe8b77f5b"
    },
    "cc0a6da448c25403": {
      "text": "行动结束。请闭眼，并保持安静。",
      "duration": 3.975,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/cc0a6da448c25403.mp3",
      "textHash": "cc0a6da448c2540317acb0804a749c79a1fb1c15d01f1826bb42273809f67b7a"
    },
    "e545c27b67b8f694": {
      "text": "拥有首夜技能的角色，请根据设备上的私密提示行动。其他玩家请保持闭眼。",
      "duration": 7.475,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/e545c27b67b8f694.mp3",
      "textHash": "e545c27b67b8f6946660056b78cdddfd1c914b8313bb61618e9c70d0525d0829"
    },
    "30373db5a0305723": {
      "text": "狼人请睁眼。请在设备上选择今晚的目标。其他玩家请保持闭眼。",
      "duration": 6.525,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/30373db5a0305723.mp3",
      "textHash": "30373db5a03057231bcb1275b6cb8997f2c3835167caba9cf0c337d83ad87ef9"
    },
    "f6cfc1735117250c": {
      "text": "守卫请睁眼。请选择今晚要守护的玩家。",
      "duration": 4.7,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/f6cfc1735117250c.mp3",
      "textHash": "f6cfc1735117250cfabb724240a34e33a257400fd722d7c3d55874e71f02f450"
    },
    "56a384bac2bef11f": {
      "text": "魔术师请睁眼。请按私密提示交换两名玩家，或选择跳过。",
      "duration": 6.075,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/56a384bac2bef11f.mp3",
      "textHash": "56a384bac2bef11fcd2bc130efe44a734e72053d785591617a2349b376686f22"
    },
    "c0898d99089c6248": {
      "text": "摄梦人请睁眼。请选择今晚的梦游者。",
      "duration": 4.525,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/c0898d99089c6248.mp3",
      "textHash": "c0898d99089c6248961146f709491221488498156ee2f8e66e37eade4e4e98a8"
    },
    "a880911336adf19d": {
      "text": "预言家请睁眼。请选择要查验的玩家，并私下查看结果。",
      "duration": 6.0,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/a880911336adf19d.mp3",
      "textHash": "a880911336adf19d3bc86cd6234f8ded126763b4b5affadfe56aa057f3137517"
    },
    "161d95e00d8b9166": {
      "text": "纯白之女请睁眼。请选择要查验的玩家。",
      "duration": 4.7,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/161d95e00d8b9166.mp3",
      "textHash": "161d95e00d8b9166dd3da3fcf25488255a3498a30d9a9502afa8f9d24301e4d7"
    },
    "6dfff36a07d14431": {
      "text": "狼巫请睁眼。请根据设备上的私密技能提示行动。",
      "duration": 5.35,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/6dfff36a07d14431.mp3",
      "textHash": "6dfff36a07d144310a2975357dc3f5f2eea0c0bb01031b2589b2cb5308a1d07e"
    },
    "0ba3103a60f83b66": {
      "text": "石像鬼请睁眼。请选择要查验的玩家。",
      "duration": 4.525,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/0ba3103a60f83b66.mp3",
      "textHash": "0ba3103a60f83b669bf85ee0f7c5a389978e598df64be285e6797301dde16eb6"
    },
    "e2cbf1700d157f7d": {
      "text": "女巫请睁眼。请查看私密信息，然后决定是否使用药水。",
      "duration": 6.0,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/e2cbf1700d157f7d.mp3",
      "textHash": "e2cbf1700d157f7d362ac790a2c5e970b497be8596b739ea70680592e8dcfa82"
    },
    "a629d85b8c335def": {
      "text": "狼美人请睁眼。请选择要魅惑的玩家。",
      "duration": 4.425,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/a629d85b8c335def.mp3",
      "textHash": "a629d85b8c335def577af099d2aebb6657ed7860838cca7573f738bf5c1f9091"
    },
    "b19bc389594e585d": {
      "text": "乌鸦请睁眼。请选择要诅咒的玩家。",
      "duration": 4.325,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/b19bc389594e585d.mp3",
      "textHash": "b19bc389594e585db4d84ed4b8496687b520d7458b036e1e385f3bebd8f249bd"
    },
    "669eee0cc81c7263": {
      "text": "守墓人请睁眼。请查看设备上的私密信息。",
      "duration": 4.825,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/669eee0cc81c7263.mp3",
      "textHash": "669eee0cc81c7263d252f535ab0fbc16093477965ded65676064a6df2c4449ab"
    },
    "43e0e49c89dc96dd": {
      "text": "猎魔人请睁眼。请根据私密提示选择狩猎，或跳过。",
      "duration": 5.525,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/43e0e49c89dc96dd.mp3",
      "textHash": "43e0e49c89dc96dd7af7a0ca6cf791632b4d9669b6c9963af3e381416f0de8f7"
    },
    "039f90c23b4dc967": {
      "text": "吹笛者请睁眼。请选择要迷惑的玩家。",
      "duration": 4.5,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/039f90c23b4dc967.mp3",
      "textHash": "039f90c23b4dc967e9cf0b014fc3e21fde983d4b4322481a65daae94c6ca248f"
    },
    "56a5b9d5bbae86b9": {
      "text": "血月使徒请睁眼。请根据设备上的私密技能提示行动。",
      "duration": 5.7,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/56a5b9d5bbae86b9.mp3",
      "textHash": "56a5b9d5bbae86b914c9737875ea2a32d2611cf21839218f33bf5ba73c2c1eaa"
    },
    "3c2012faab5c608d": {
      "text": "丘比特请睁眼。请根据设备上的私密提示，选择两名情侣。其他玩家请保持闭眼。",
      "duration": 8.0,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/3c2012faab5c608d.mp3",
      "textHash": "3c2012faab5c608df7c1d99dfa3b09dc833a35a314638ab5eb85de066ed7f3b2"
    },
    "8cc248aa1701100a": {
      "text": "野孩子请睁眼。请根据设备上的私密提示，选择你的榜样。其他玩家请保持闭眼。",
      "duration": 7.6,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/8cc248aa1701100a.mp3",
      "textHash": "8cc248aa1701100ad5d13ac54974c548290ba3923bb8e28d23942308613ec62c"
    },
    "8274c76a5cee5094": {
      "text": "狼狗请睁眼。请根据设备上的私密提示，选择好人或狼人阵营。其他玩家请保持闭眼。",
      "duration": 8.35,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/8274c76a5cee5094.mp3",
      "textHash": "8274c76a5cee509409a7dbf6898525f528a017d8b934957b6f075ec4c9588d49"
    },
    "a5648c46ffa1c81f": {
      "text": "盗贼请睁眼。请根据设备上的私密提示，从提供的两个身份中选择一个。其他玩家请保持闭眼。",
      "duration": 9.2,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/a5648c46ffa1c81f.mp3",
      "textHash": "a5648c46ffa1c81f3d717a097ea091c27015bd81fa042b1c65001fa12950099b"
    },
    "73f7f2b1cd679e2e": {
      "text": "机械狼请睁眼。请根据设备上的私密提示，选择一名玩家，学习其身份。其他玩家请保持闭眼。",
      "duration": 9.425,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/73f7f2b1cd679e2e.mp3",
      "textHash": "73f7f2b1cd679e2ef168e496c10e066cfe79018dd4190fec4665e4dd33372340"
    },
    "2840162cd4838468": {
      "text": "昨夜出局的玩家是：",
      "duration": 2.7,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/2840162cd4838468.mp3",
      "textHash": "2840162cd483846821adeea380b14e8e77cbe1f1caa75d736c6a3ccb209c6d5b"
    },
    "0454664836a93984": {
      "text": "昨夜是平安夜，无人出局。",
      "duration": 3.45,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/0454664836a93984.mp3",
      "textHash": "0454664836a93984e8eefbcf1f0be74eda0f63a0cf8295889901a08f6da90221"
    },
    "6e95ef0a45ab0dca": {
      "text": "本届警长是：",
      "duration": 2.175,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/6e95ef0a45ab0dca.mp3",
      "textHash": "6e95ef0a45ab0dcabc10272326bbaa4091bbbffda27215e519f7a887ebedfec7"
    },
    "5490aec7e9f07a7f": {
      "text": "本局没有选出警长，不设警徽。",
      "duration": 3.825,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/5490aec7e9f07a7f.mp3",
      "textHash": "5490aec7e9f07a7f63e766e4a9e8f6460d1c8d245f799ee3b74ce82ce6393ab2"
    },
    "fd52a2f22708ac3c": {
      "text": "暂不公布昨夜结果。所有玩家请在设备上选择是否上警。",
      "duration": 5.975,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/fd52a2f22708ac3c.mp3",
      "textHash": "fd52a2f22708ac3ced443e9627f683b57d0b36df89dfc29060df663da3bf6108"
    },
    "7bcc1869313d1d1f": {
      "text": "警长候选人按座位顺序发言。发言结束后请点击完成。可以退水，但退水玩家不能投票。",
      "duration": 8.675,
      "src": "/assets/nightfall/narrators/kokoro/7bcc1869313d1d1f.mp3",
      "textHash": "7bcc1869313d1d1f91abe5249c41272c832e5ea92043ea2d20269cc5a0dd9c30"
    },
